                                        "sense_id": "8a28f55c-371f-33be-a82e-85cfa8226880",
                                        "entry_id": "cd4f8cfe-8852-367a-ba76-a4a8c7cd0201",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The penis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "childish",
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2777ea40-efe2-40af-9019-9008e9b07ca5",
                                                "sense_id": "8a28f55c-371f-33be-a82e-85cfa8226880",
                                                "text": "“I agree he’s gorgeous,” said his friend, “but someone told me he has the smallest wee-wee in New York.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8abfa8bd-b343-3812-a52e-4e352ff90bb1",
                                        "entry_id": "cd4f8cfe-8852-367a-ba76-a4a8c7cd0201",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The vulva or vagina."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "childish",
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87f21055-0d5d-40be-96b5-cd725a45ee1e",
                                                "sense_id": "8abfa8bd-b343-3812-a52e-4e352ff90bb1",
                                                "text": "But because little girls' genitals are tucked away, it's easy never to refer to them at all. They become the part with no name. Even up-front women are flummoxed. Vagina? Fanny? Front bottom? Twinkie? Privates? Didge? Down there? Flower? Wee-wee? Tuppence?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a23d5aa-ef5b-4180-ba01-d7c5f42901df",
                                                "sense_id": "8abfa8bd-b343-3812-a52e-4e352ff90bb1",
                                                "text": "‘Wee wee’ was the word my parent’s taught me to call my vagina."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wee-wee",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aab7791b-9d45-3c3b-b46a-4b889e4202bb",
                                        "entry_id": "47a0a40e-00c8-371c-ba82-59509cd66cc6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "to urinate"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "informal",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1f1c356-b492-4156-9d77-00dd530b840a",
                                                "sense_id": "aab7791b-9d45-3c3b-b46a-4b889e4202bb",
                                                "text": "“This is Bruce who doesn’t wee-wee in the sandbox.” Bruce looked pleased with himself. Mrs. Kemp felt a need to apologize for her granddaughter. “Willa Jean doesn’t mean what she says.” “But I don’t wee-wee in the sandbox,” said Bruce. “I wee-wee in the-”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b31f3297-6b62-4a2a-b3ef-0b64f7087df1",
                        "source_entry_id": "f013ec0f-dac7-3943-9c1a-8a68d18b8f84",
                        "source_sense_id": "d9a79e50-8c19-3a9b-bedc-61a3feb6fd5b",
                        "source_sense_description": "kindersprachlich: Urin",
                        "target_lang_word": "pipi",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pipi",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9d2ecaa-c554-3fa5-8c7b-c27ef3d0bdc6",
                                        "entry_id": "d7ed7871-5aab-338b-904e-446eb9ddc5a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Urine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cd69706-4e26-456a-a219-924537a8895d",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d2ecaa-c554-3fa5-8c7b-c27ef3d0bdc6",
                                                "text": "Pourtant, ce sont des sanitaires de lycée. Ceux qui, dans les souvenirs de nombre d’entre nous, sentent le pipi macéré, manquent continuellement de papier et dont les verrous dysfonctionnent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8475cd87-591f-48c3-a4e2-80b1e76643b3",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d2ecaa-c554-3fa5-8c7b-c27ef3d0bdc6",
                                                "text": "Argent mon ami tu n’es pas très fidèle\nEt tu n’es pas souvent là quand j’ai vraiment besoin de toi\nMais où es-tu, argent, quand mon frigo fait pipi\nQuand j’ai beaucoup trop perçu mon ami le RMI"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02b09cb0-b4f8-4fd8-9a1a-87d4298ce520",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d2ecaa-c554-3fa5-8c7b-c27ef3d0bdc6",
                                                "text": "Sur la place, Bram découvre un chien: lui aussi doit faire pipi. Il se met à côté de lui et ensemble ils font pipi contre un arbre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1081aa79-b0b7-4ce8-a779-494167c13543",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d2ecaa-c554-3fa5-8c7b-c27ef3d0bdc6",
                                                "text": "– Don Zizzi te coupera le zizi, quand il verra que t’as fait pipi sur son tapis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "676c1efe-010b-35a6-bf68-875ea74a89db",
                                        "entry_id": "d7ed7871-5aab-338b-904e-446eb9ddc5a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Breuvage de qualité médiocre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ironic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9751f82a-bee9-4a87-90c7-33e40bce780e",
                                                "sense_id": "676c1efe-010b-35a6-bf68-875ea74a89db",
                                                "text": "— J’ai les chaussettes mouillées.\n— Tu les sécheras au feu.\n— Ne récrimine pas contre cette eau ! Quand tu l’auras goûtée, tu m’en diras des nouvelles ! Ah ! ce n’est pas du pipi de robinet ! Les roches du Meygal lui donnent une saveur unique.\n— Quand j’ai de l’eau dans mes chaussettes, je me fiche bien du goût qu’elle a."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
